{"name": "Lineup, Dark Lord! : Auto Battler", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"204\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/5596fe85b3d19291dd56466bf8955b3e.avif?t=1787410896\" width=\"800\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Lead your Demon Army!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\"Line Up, Dark Lord!\" is a casual deck-building game where you build your own Demon army lineup to push back the enemy. Create the ultimate monster combination and stand at the top of the Underworld once again!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/3c71e10cad27c2170f877b661831564c.poster.avif?t=1787410896\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/3c71e10cad27c2170f877b661831564c.webm?t=1787410896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/3c71e10cad27c2170f877b661831564c.mp4?t=1787410896\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Assemble your Demon Army!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc7e <strong>Build Your Ultimate Demon Army Deck!</strong><br/>Combine unique monsters to create a one-of-a-kind, ultimate deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f <strong>The 'One-Line' Placement Strategy That Decides Victory!</strong><br/>Battles take place on a single line! Carefully decide the order of your monsters to trigger perfect synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddea <strong>Ultra-Fast Monster Fusion System!</strong><br/>Fuse monsters to acquire higher-tier monsters faster and instantly boost your combat power!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/45db2c40956a6cdef0291a0404bc4646.poster.avif?t=1787410896\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/45db2c40956a6cdef0291a0404bc4646.webm?t=1787410896\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/45db2c40956a6cdef0291a0404bc4646.mp4?t=1787410896\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Brawl in the Arena to Find the Ultimate Champion!</strong><br/>Break free from constraints, mix and match traits, and engage in real duels with users worldwide!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"95\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/e23e8e9dade401e70bab8ca70a344048.avif?t=1787410896\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"95\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/238ba7118d4ae7f6bd78c9df811ac248.avif?t=1787410896\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"95\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/840813381e731f333d53ca79d88eb139.avif?t=1787410896\" width=\"400\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"95\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4986500/extras/